ectory-eval-harness\n\nA runnable demonstration of trajectory evaluation for agentic AI:\ngrade the agent's path, not just its final answer, and expose\npass^k reliability that pass@1 hides.\n\n- store.py: the world (fresh truth + a stale-cache trap)\n- agent.py: the system under test; sometimes reads the stale record\n- prepare.py: derives locked ground truth -> eval_set.json\n- run.py: executes the agent K=8 times per task -> runs.json\n- report.py: grades runs, computes metrics, applies the CI gate\n- .github/workflows/eval.yml: prepare -> run -> report as a merge gate\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01EC5GSjSSc2PHtVxMBGC6yM","tree":{"sha":"5a738c107a4e1d8c6618b0460cec1b3ee63a496d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Evals-pass-1/git/trees/5a738c107a4e1d8c6618b0460cec1b3ee63a496d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Evals-pass-1/git/commits/cc07dafdc041b3936ae1451ddbc27f4146729eba","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDGlJrkx\nWg3xpymsgVS9Hk//EUyghMGWXjB/qROCzXAEvpJ+JK+TJFZhRa7UwoEJnrgLQdzvYiMnwvYbmaLf\n0Qs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 5a738c107a4e1d8c6618b0460cec1b3ee63a496d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780811175 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780811175 +0000\n\nAdd trajectory-eval-harness\n\nA runnable demonstration of trajectory evaluation for agentic AI:\ngrade the agent's path, not just its final answer, and expose\npass^k reliability that pass@1 hides.\n\n- store.py: the world (fresh truth + a stale-cache trap)\n- agent.py: the system under test; sometimes reads the stale record\n- prepare.py: derives locked ground truth -> eval_set.json\n- run.py: executes the agent K=8 times per task -> runs.json\n- report.py: grades runs, computes metrics, applies the CI gate\n- .github/workflows/eval.yml: prepare -> run -> report as a merge gate\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01EC5GSjSSc2PHtVxMBGC6yM\n","verified_at":"2026-06-07T05:46:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Evals-pass-1/commits/cc07dafdc041b3936ae1451ddbc27f4146729eba","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/Evals-pass-1/commit/cc07dafdc041b3936ae1451ddbc27f4146729eba","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Evals-pass-1/commits/cc07dafdc041b3936ae1451ddbc27f4146729eba/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c